  "solution": {
    "text": "<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0004_ac32a3542cff.png\"><br><br />Let $(h, k)$ is centre of circle<br />$\\left|\\frac{h-k}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right|=|h|, k^2-h^2+2 h k=0$"
  }
